  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NOR-Combating Harmful Traditions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to combat attitudes and practices leading to discrimination of women and girls in Bajhang. The three main practices are a) Chhaupadi (segregation of women during menstruation) b) Gender based violence c) Alcohol abuse</narrative>
  </description>
